* Mainframe Lab configuration of the pinned PDPCLIB service assembler.
* MVSSUPA retains its notices; the PDSE correction is a separate patch.
* Upstream switch names are separate from our C ABI/profile names.
* S390 selects ordinary AMODE31 services and LOC=RES storage behavior.
         GBLC  &COMP,&ZSYS,&XSYS,&ZAM64,&STEPD,&OS,&OUTM
&COMP    SETC  'GCC'
&ZSYS    SETC  'S390'
&XSYS    SETC  'ZARCH'
&ZAM64   SETC  'NO'
&STEPD   SETC  'YES'
&OUTM    SETC  'M'
&OS      SETC  'MVS'
         AMODE 31
         RMODE ANY
